cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  This repository is a monorepo of independent research projects; please cite
  the archived repository DOI below for the monorepo as a whole. For a
  specific project's paper or software, prefer that subdirectory's own
  README.md / CITATION.cff (where present) — see the "Projects at a glance"
  table in README.md for the full list.
title: "ResearchProj: consolidated monorepo of research projects"
version: 0.1.0
license: AGPL-3.0-only
